ol%22%3A%223%22%7D%2C%7B%22stat_heading%22%3A%22Net%20Points%22%2C%22stat_value%22%3A%221551%22%2C%22stat_icon%22%3A%22icon_1%22%2C%22stat_icon_symbol%22%3A%223%22%7D%2C%7B%22stat_heading%22%3A%22Current%20Streak%22%2C%22stat_value%22%3A%221553%22%2C%22stat_icon%22%3A%22icon_custom%22%2C%22stat_icon_symbol%22%3A%22STR%22%7D%5D\" title=\"Team Statistics\"][alc_newslog title=\"Team Newslog\"][alc_newslog_item date=\"September 18, 2016\"]<strong>Jake Summer</strong> has a <strong>composed fracture</strong> and he’s gonna be out of the field for <strong>4 months</strong>.[/alc_newslog_item][alc_newslog_item item_type=\"join\" date=\"August 24, 2016\"]<strong>Chris Greyson</strong>, a new <strong>Left Guard</strong> from New York City has joined the team!.[/alc_newslog_item][alc_newslog_item item_type=\"join\" date=\"August 17, 2016\"]<strong>Nicholas Grissom</strong>, a new <strong>Right Guard</strong> from Washington has joined the team![/alc_newslog_item][alc_newslog_item item_type=\"exit\" date=\"July 25, 2016\"]<strong>Tom Baratheon</strong> left the team after 4 years in the club and his new house are the <strong>Draconians</strong>.[/alc_newslog_item][alc_newslog_item item_type=\"award\" date=\"July 20, 2016\"]<strong>The Alchemists</strong> are the new <strong>West League Champions</strong>after a difficult final against the <strong>Lucky Clovers</strong>.[/alc_newslog_item][/alc_newslog][alc_games_history title=\"Games History\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][alc_team_points_history title=\"Points History\"][/vc_column][/vc_row]','Alchemists','','publish','closed','closed','','alchemists','','','2018-01-09 21:19:28','2018-01-09 21:19:28','',0,'http://localhost/alchemists/team/bluebirds/',0,'sp_team','',0),
